      "id": "pericles-prince-of-tyre/sceneII_27.4/p@60627",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FIRST LORD.\nTo wisdom he’s a fool that will not yield;\nAnd since Lord Helicane enjoineth us,\nWe with our travels will endeavour us.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
